{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CLdrXpiT335PrJd7XSxACJ","type":"tool_result","content":"3:`compute_unit_denominator()` is the one reduction engine spec section 13.1\n14:Known scope of this generation's denominator (documented rather than silently\n23:external hash-chain audit from inside D22. A denominator category is never\n47:    \"compute_unit_denominator\",\n64:    denominator: dict[str, Any] = field(default_factory=dict)\n108:def compute_unit_denominator(state: Mapping[str, Any], unit_id: str) -> DenominatorResult:\n109:    \"\"\"Recompute the complete current unit denominator (spec section 13.1).\"\"\"\n150:        _fail(\"curriculum domain\", \"unit_domain_denominator\", \"/domain\", \"the admitted domain head has no current passing check set\")\n166:        _fail(\"unit content\", \"unit_content_denominator\", \"/content\", \"the admitted content head has no current passing check set\")\n177:        _fail(\"unit visual\", \"unit_visual_denominator\", \"/visuals\", \"the visual join has no current passing result\")\n201:        _fail(\"unit layout\", \"unit_layout_denominator\", \"/pages\", \"the page inventory/inspection set is not current and fully passing\")\n263:        check_id=\"unit_denominator\",\n268:    return DenominatorResult(passed=passed, check=check, findings=findings, denominator=categories)\n315:def D16_REDUCE_UNIT_EVIDENCE(state: Mapping[str, Any], runtime_context: Any) -> dict[str, Any]:\n316:    \"\"\"Build the complete current unit denominator; accept it, or open repair.\"\"\"\n323:        \"an accepted unit can never re-enter denominator reduction\",\n327:    result = compute_unit_denominator(state, unit_id)\n333:                \"D16_REDUCE_UNIT_EVIDENCE\", \"unit_denominator_passed\", unit_id=unit_id\n352:    \"\"\"Recompute the full denominator immediately before minting an accepted receipt.\n366:    result = compute_unit_denominator(state, unit_id)\n371:        unit_id=unit_id, categories=result.denominator,\n382:        \"denominator\": result.denominator,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01A83BcuDzoa7A4Ptyz7sPPU","session_id":"512d45f8-5e59-47de-883c-0e101cf89d49","uuid":"fd54724d-4cf6-422b-9bc0-f1b269eaebd7","timestamp":"2026-08-13T00:56:25.283Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Verify 8 Plan 26 runtime invariants from source"}
