7. CLI: one live path (`_run_live`), fresh/resume both call `build_curriculum_factory_graph` once each; no simulation/session-bridge/Plan-25 references reachable — **PASS**\n\n## 5. Adversarial/regression completeness, no waived tests (TEST item 5)\n\nN50's own receipt is `PASSED`. N90 reran the complete suite directly against\ncurrent code:\n\n```\n/tmp/plan26_n30_verify/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/runtime -rs\n```\n```\nSKIPPED [1] tests/runtime/test_plan26_lock_drift.py:220: pinned generator absent (needs pip==25.3, pip-tools==7.6.0); CI installs both\n1246 passed, 1 skipped, 406 subtests passed in 128.14s (0:02:08)\n```\n\nZero failures, zero errors, zero xfail/xpass. The one skip is an\nenvironment-only gap (a pinned pip/pip-tools generator not installed on this\nhost; the test's own reason string states CI installs both) — not a test\ndeleted, weakened, or waived to hide a defect. Full output:\n`evidence/N90_FINAL_AUDIT/full_suite_rerun.txt`.\n\n## 6. Activation gate (TEST items 6-7)\n\n- N50 status: **PASSED** (receipt, and reconfirmed live in section 5).\n- N60 status: **NOT_AVAILABLE**. `results/N60_LIVE_PRODUCT_PROOF.result.v1.md`\n  shows Codex is live-authenticated (ChatGPT subscription) and both provider\n  hosts are network-reachable, but the Gemini CLI has no usable credential in\n  this environment (`gemini-api-key` auth mode selected, `GEMINI_API_KEY`/\n  `GOOGLE_API_KEY` unset, no Google account signed in) — a real,\n  non-simulated probe exits 41 before any curriculum content is constructed\n  or transmitted. This reproduces spec section 20.2's recorded external\n  prerequisite (\"provide live credentials/network access for Codex,\n  Gemini...\") and matches this project's standing constraint (no billed API\n  keys provisioned for this user; only Claude Code and ChatGPT Pro/Codex\n  subscriptions exist). This is an external account/credential gap, not an\n  implementation defect — the runtime, transport, and preflight code all\n  report ready (`--preflight` returns `ready: true`).\n- Therefore: N50 passed and N60 is `NOT_AVAILABLE` solely for a recorded\n  external prerequisite — TEST item 7's condition for\n  `IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED` is met. TEST item 6's condition for `ACTIVATED`\n  (authorized live unit + full-release proof) is not met and was not\n  attempted, correctly.\n\n## Findings summary / rework_edges\n\n| Finding | rework_edges key | Owning node | Disposition |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| N40 evidence files (`preflight_read_only.txt`, `plan25_resume_refusal.txt`) embed a `tempfile`-randomized path and cannot reproduce receipted bytes on any full-suite rerun | `evidence_integrity_drift` | N40_CLI_CUTOVER | Non-blocking, informational, per approved patch P-N90-001 — structural test-design non-determinism, not an implementation defect; verified no other file/kind of drift exists |\n\nNo finding blocks this verdict. No finding recurred a second or third time\nwithin this attempt, and no finding reflects ambiguous ownership or missing\nevidence.\n\n## Verdict rationale\n\nAll 7 invariant classes pass on direct, current-code re-verification; the\ncomplete regression/adversarial suite passes clean (1246 passed, 1\nenvironment-only skip, 0 failures); the production path is singular with no\nforbidden import or legacy fallback reachable; every receipted artifact hash\nis verified current and valid except a patch-covered, already-diagnosed,\nnon-blocking test-evidence non-determinism. N60 correctly reports\n`NOT_AVAILABLE` for a genuine, evidenced external prerequisite (live Gemini\ncredential) rather than any implementation gap. Per TEST item 7, the truthful\nverdict is:\n\n**`IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED`**\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":200,"newStart":2,"newLines":187,"lines":[" "," ## VERDICT: `IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED`"," ","-This is an independent audit against the live top-level repository","-(`/Users/filipepinto/Projects/curriculum_builder`), not a trust of prior nodes'","-own claims: 