25 references — **PASS**","+7. CLI: one live path (`_run_live`), fresh/resume both call `build_curriculum_factory_graph` once each; no simulation/session-bridge/Plan-25 references reachable — **PASS**"," "," ## 5. Adversarial/regression completeness, no waived tests (TEST item 5)"," ","-N50's own receipt (`796e197370e4...`, PASSED, `1235 passed, 1 skipped, 406","-subtests` at receipt time) maps every spec 17.2 adversarial row to a named","-test (`tests/runtime/test_plan26_adversarial.py`, 26 tests, hash","-`0cbca18f412dd63b1c1a82fb535deb4ab50c8bcb8885fc02f2fa421d601c5a04`, matches","-receipt exactly — unchanged). Per Finding F2, N90 did not stop at that","-receipt (its ancestors were reworked afterward) and reran the complete suite","-directly:","+N50's own receipt is `PASSED`. N90 reran the complete suite directly against","+current code:"," "," ```"," /tmp/plan26_n30_verify/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/runtime -rs"," ```"," ```"," SKIPPED [1] tests/runtime/test_plan26_lock_drift.py:220: pinned generator absent (needs pip==25.3, pip-tools==7.6.0); CI installs both","-1246 passed, 1 skipped, 406 subtests passed in 145.09s (0:02:25)","+1246 passed, 1 skipped, 406 subtests passed in 128.14s (0:02:08)"," ```"," "," Zero failures, zero errors, zero xfail/xpass. The one skip is an"," environment-only gap (a pinned pip/pip-tools generator not installed on this","-host; CI installs both per the test's own reason string) — not a test that","-was deleted, weakened, or waived to hide a defect. This also confirms the","-`test_run_curriculum.py` / `parser_for` collection error and the","-`test_plan26_prompt_graph_controller.py` meta-harness failures N50's own","-result markdown flagged as environment-specific (isolated-sandbox artifacts,","-not Plan 26 runtime defects) no longer reproduce against the live repo:","-`parser_for` is confirmed absent and `build_parser` is the live API","-(`runtime/run_curriculum.py:49,121`), and the harness receipt store is","-populated here. Full output: `evidence/N90_FINAL_AUDIT/full_suite_rerun.txt`.","+host; the test's own reason string states CI installs both) — not a test","+deleted, weakened, or waived to hide a defect. Full output:","+`evidence/N90_FINAL_AUDIT/full_suite_rerun.txt`."," "," ## 6. Activation gate (TEST items 6-7)"," ","-- N50 status: **PASSED** (original receipt, and reconfirmed live in section 5).","-- N60 status: **NOT_AVAILABLE**. Its own evidence (`results/N60_LIVE_PRODUCT_PROOF.result.v1.md`) shows Codex is live-authenticated (ChatGPT subscription) and both provider hosts are network-reachable, but the Gemini CLI has no usable credential in this environment (`gemini-api-key` auth mode selected, `GEMINI_API_KEY`/`GOOGLE_API_KEY` unset, no Google account signed in) — a real, non-simulated probe failure (exit 41), reproducing the exact prerequisite spec section 20.2 lists (\"provide live credentials/network access for Codex, Gemini...\"). No partial transmission was attempted; no curriculum artifact was produced or claimed. This is an external account/credential gap, not an implementation defect — the runtime, transport, and preflight code all report ready.","-- Therefore: N60 is `NOT_AVAILABLE` solely for a recorded external prerequisite, and N50 passed (both originally and on N90's live rerun). TEST item 7's condition for `IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED` is met. TEST item 6's condition for `ACTIVATED` (authorized live unit + full-release proof) is not met and was not attempted, correctly.","+- N50 status: **PASSED** (receipt, and reconfirmed live in section 5).","+- N60 status: **NOT_AVAILABLE**. `results/N60_LIVE_PRODUCT_PROOF.result.v1.md`","+  shows Codex is live-authenticated (ChatGPT subscription) and both provider","+  hosts are network-reachable, but the Gemini CLI has no usable credential in","+  this environment (`gemini-api-key` auth mode selected, `GEMINI_API_KEY`/","+  `GOOGLE_API_KEY` unset, no Google account signed in) — a real,","+  non-simulated probe exits 41 before any